# Agentic Marketing Teams — Self-Hosted

Replace $920/mo of proprietary tools with $5-20/mo open-source stack.

**Data:** Airbyte → ClickHouse | **Images:** ComfyUI + SDXL | **Video:** Wav2Lip + Coqui TTS | **Research:** SearXNG + Ollama | **Hosting:** Coolify/Docker

**Weekly cycle:** Research pain points (Mon) → Create ads (Tue-Wed) → Publish & optimize (Thu-Sun)

**FB API:** Write-only, 0.5s rate limit, start PAUSED. Daily cap $50.

